WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
For students aged twelve to eighteen, welcome to The Innovation Studio.

2
00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
This is a professional dark-mode development environment inspired by VS Code, running full Python 3.11 right in the browser via Pyodide.

3
00:12.000 --> 00:20.000
In The Agri-Sorter lab, students build real neural networks and convolutional image classifiers to detect blight and rust on crops.

4
00:20.000 --> 00:26.500
They evaluate real confusion matrices, training loss curves, and validation accuracy metrics.

5
00:26.500 --> 00:33.500
In our Smart Hardware module, students control a simulated IoT home with Python scripts and in-browser voice recognition.

6
00:33.500 --> 00:41.000
And in our Ethics forum, students debate autonomous vehicle moral algorithms and audit algorithmic bias in facial recognition.

